---
---
<section id="hero" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <img class="avatar" src="/images/headshot.jpg" alt="Rob Smith" width="128" height="128" />
    <p class="eyebrow">Hi, I'm</p>
    <h1>Rob</h1>
    <p class="title">Lead Principal Customer Success Manager, EMEA at Webflow</p>
    <p class="greeting">and I'm really glad that you're here.</p>
    <p class="bio">
      I've spent the last seven-plus years helping enterprise customers get real value out of the
      tools they've invested in — building the kind of trust that turns into renewals, expansion,
      and long-term partnerships, not one-off transactions. I was a founding member of Webflow's
      Enterprise Customer Success team, and I care a lot about building processes that scale
      rather than reinventing the wheel with every account.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .avatar {
    display: block;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .greeting {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-greeting);
    margin: 0.25rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .bio {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  section#hero {
    padding-top: 5rem;
  }
</style>
